=2 Walkthrough
* Enter **Neptune's Spire** in {z:Lower Jeuno} (F-7) and click on the door to the Tenshodo headquarters for a cutscene.
* Go to {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} (H-7) and head toward the **Audience Chamber** of the palace. You will receive a cutscene when you reach the stairs.
** You can now progress past the {p:Rhapsodies of Vana'diel} mission {M:Crashing Waves|Crashing Waves|Crashing Waves}. If you're on that mission, you'll immediately get the cutscene after finishing this mission since both are at the same place.

=2 Optional (Jeuno)
* The following quests are available after starting this mission. (Level 40+)
** {q:A Chocobo's Tale|A Chocobo's Tale|A Chocobo's Tale} is available in {z:Upper Jeuno}.
** {q:Hook, Line, and Sinker|Hook, Line, and Sinker|Hook, Line, and Sinker} is available in {z:Lower Jeuno}.
** {q:In the Mood for Love|In the Mood for Love|In the Mood for Love} is available in {z:Lower Jeuno}.
* {q:Ducal Hospitality|Ducal Hospitality|Ducal Hospitality} will be available in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} after completion of this mission. (Level 40+)

